  m_Text: 'As Vesper, a shadow-stitcher courier of the twilight district, cross the
    skylines

    to ignite the Sanctum Beacon and deliver the sealed Memory Shards.


    Move:
    A/D or Arrows   |   Jump: SPACE / W   |   Shadow-Cloak Glide: Hold SPACE or SHIFT

    Stomp
    Clockwork Sentinels from above   |   Pause: ESC / P'
